{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301760","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301760","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1230176001:1":{"text":"항구가 봉쇄되고 부두에서 함께 일하던 친구들과 같이 물귀신파에 들어갔어. 어쨌든 뱃일도 일거리도 없었으니까. 우리도 먹고는 살아야 할 것 아니야!","source_cn":"封港后不久，我和几个码头干粗活的朋友一起投靠了水鬼帮。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2180D69C3B83AD38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230176002:1":{"text":"하지만 다시 부두로 돌아온 건 나뿐이야. 다른 녀석들은 모두 죽음의 함대에 이끌려서 바닷속에 묻혀버렸지.","source_cn":"可现在，回到这个码头的只剩下我。好多兄弟都被死潮舰队一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84283ECC1B2CFAF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230176003:1":{"text":"러스트 항을 떠날 때만 해도 다들 우유부단한 치카바를 무시했던 적이 있었지.","source_cn":"离开锈锚港的时候，我还有些看不起奇卡瓦，因为他总是这副...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EB3223D0B444C2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230176004:1":{"text":"하지만 지금 보니 죽는 것보다 조금 배고픈 게 나은 것 같아.","source_cn":"可现在看来，即使饿一阵子肚子，也好过脑袋分家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8EC386FBF155DAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:水鬼帮威特":{"text":"물귀신파 위트","source":"水鬼帮威特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}